        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "rae lai",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100821350661803832076/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVJ8Mdk2ZyIOD0_1qaYY6jbwowOfUlpxnlVGYW4HROPenLxTXgC=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3"
        },
        "publishTime": "2024-08-27T04:56:44.722773Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ3emZuQ3NRRRAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ3emZuQ3NRRRAB!2m1!1s0x340401662f4bd97b:0x561b6597e10a969a"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJe9lLL2YBBDQRmpYK4ZdlG1Y/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21zNVNsTkNUM1prTVRsZmF6RXljazFUZURsV01FRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "8 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "Google地圖上顯示營業到晚上11點，但我問後得知營業到下午1點。他們非常友好。旅行途中，有一天晚上回飯店前，我點了一杯雞尾酒和一份簡餐。大部分客人都是外國人，我沒看到任何亞洲人或韓國人。在戶外一邊喝著飲料一邊聽著音樂，真的為我的旅程增添了不少情調。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "구글에는 11시 까지 영업으로 나오는데 물어보니 한시까지 한다고 해요. 아주 친절합니다. 여행하다가 밤에 칵테일이랑 간단히 안주시켜서 먹고 호텔 들어갔어요. 거의 외국인 손님이고 동양인이나 한국인은 못봤어요. 야외에서 음악들으며 한잔하니 여행 분위기 물씬 나고 좋았어요.",
          "languageCode": "ko"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "박낭콩",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108869706321518408741/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUMpUPeVyCOW_gcSicoLgJMsNs9Q5WoXvgMAdsno5ldYL2kcHg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo"
        },
        "publishTime": "2026-02-04T16:53:34.103595666Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21zNVNsTkNUM1prTVRsZmF6RXljazFUZURsV01FRRAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21zNVNsTkNUM1prTVRsZmF6RXljazFUZURsV01FRRAB!2m1!1s0x340401662f4bd97b:0x561b6597e10a969a"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJe9lLL2YBBDQRmpYK4ZdlG1Y/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSd1NscHhSMm95WDI1ellUUjJSbU55WjNsaU4xRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "11 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "這家酒吧離上環iClub很近！長相思和夏多內都很好喝（強烈推薦Chauvet）。我還點了一份墨西哥薄餅當配菜，也很好吃。洗手間是室內的，而且很乾淨！強烈推薦。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "아이클럽 셩완에서 가까운 바 입니다!\n쇼비뇽 블랑이랑 샤도네이 둘다 맛있었어요(쇼블을 좀더 추천) 안주로 퀘사디아 시켰는데 퀘사디아도 맛있습니다. 화장실 실내에 있고 깨끗했어요! 추천추천",
          "languageCode": "ko"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Emily Pak",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113973126990561702021/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKmq3xQdoHlypCbSt1cEA59dLD8zjYq3l42jwDwOGN4B_3NXFg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2"
        },
        "publishTime": "2025-11-26T10:00:41.274871993Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSd1NscHhSMm95WDI1ellUUjJSbU55WjNsaU4xRRAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSd1NscHhSMm95WDI1ellUUjJSbU55WjNsaU4xRRAB!2m1!1s0x340401662f4bd97b:0x561b6597e10a969a"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJe9lLL2YBBDQRmpYK4ZdlG1Y/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURjb0pHWkdREAE",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "6 年前",
        "rating": 2,
        "text": {
          "text": "這家店位置很方便，就在路邊，但是食物一般般。唯一的好處就是人少，不用排隊。我覺得員工需要加強訓練──他們刷卡機出了問題，印不出顧客聯，竟然沒人告訴我們，直接把收據和信用卡都還給了我，直到我主動詢問。以後不會再去了。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Conveniently situated along the road but the food was so-so only. The only good thing is there’s no crowd and no queue. I think the staff need more training - when they had a problem with the credit card machine and couldn’t print a customer copy of the receipt, no one told us and they simply returned the receipt and my credit card to me, until I asked. Not going back",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Dariel Lim",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104797718934444749009/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWzWC9AfYSVZaH4RM7McasGTY4z7TJzELPutqFaIm9CDJ3Wz9h8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5"
